 "description": "Borghans1997 - Calcium Oscillation - Model 1\nBioModels BIOMD0000000043 (curated). SBML file: BIOMD0000000043_url.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 10 time units (SED-ML: BIOMD0000000043_url.sedml (auto-generated placeholder); duration chosen from the dynamics: oscillating), sampling 0.01.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 4.22e-06 of species peak (worst: Rho)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] 'EC' goes below zero in the SBML: integrated as EC_o = value + 2, output as EC = OUTC[EC_o;-2*source]\n  [info] 'Fraction_Inactive_Channels' goes below zero in the SBML: integrated as Fraction_Inactive_Channe_o = value + 2, output as Fraction_Inactive_Channels = OUTC[Fraction_Inactive_Channe_o;-2*source]\n  [info] v2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] v3: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed",
